---
description: Never commit secrets, env files, or signing material
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not commit secrets or signing material. Hooks refuse the commit if they appear.

Stay out of git: `.env`, API keys, tokens, `.pem` / `.p12` / `.p8`, provisioning profiles, Android keystores, `key.properties`, `credentials.json`, and dogfood workspace data.

Protection: `.gitignore`, `hk` pre-commit (`betterleaks`), and `.cursor/hooks` on `git commit`. After clone: `mise install && hk install --mise`.
